  "format": "entries are the Entry records the client holds (fields plus their stamps); excluded is NotebookState(notebookID).excluded; contextNotebooks is that NotebookState's contextNotebooks and relatedNotebookIDs the Notebook's relatedNotebookIDs, as their sets hold them (an element counts while its value is true; absent is empty); notebooks maps each zone (Library or Space-<spaceID>) to the notebooks the client holds there with their redirect fields, as in resolve.json, and resolve(id) is resolveNotebook from the zone that holds id (Library first, then the spaces by name), or id itself when no zone does. notebookID is already resolved. own(c) = the entries with containerID c, itemKind source, state active and approval approved or absent. ctx = {resolve(c) | c in contextNotebooks} intersected with {resolve(r) | r in relatedNotebookIDs}, minus resolve(notebookID), sorted (expectContextNotebooks, when given). expect (sorted) is the chat's context: the itemIDs of own(notebookID) and of own(c) for every c in ctx (one level), minus each s whose excluded[s] equals stamps.state + \"|\" + (stamps.approval ?? \"-\") of e_s, its entry in own(notebookID), else its entry in own(c) for the smallest c (plain string order; the ids are ASCII). expectStudio (sorted; expect when absent) is the Studio's context: own(notebookID) minus the same exclusions.",
  "status": "Seed set written with WP1; the merge and split cases follow §5.2 as revision 2 decides it: a chat resolves its notebook first (resolve.json) and reads the survivor's or heir's NotebookState; a merge carries no exclusion of the merged notebook's (its sources arrive ticked, as today), and an emptying split copies the parent's exclusions to the heir unchanged. Revision 5 adds D52's context notebooks (cases D52:), and revision 6 resolves both lists before they are intersected (cases R6-m1:); every case checks the Studio's context too.",
  "cases": [
    {"name":"every active approved source is ticked","notebookID":"nb1","entries":[{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_a","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa","approval":"L1759400001000.0000.aaaaaaaa"},"approval":"approved"},{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_b","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa"}}],"excluded":{},"expect":["src_a","src_b"]},
    {"name":"pending and rejected suggestions are not in context; absent approval means approved","notebookID":"nb1","entries":[{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_a","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa","approval":"L1759400001000.0000.aaaaaaaa"},"approval":"pending"},{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_b","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa","approval":"L1759400001000.0000.aaaaaaaa"},"approval":"rejected"},{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_c","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa"}}],"excluded":{},"expect":["src_c"]},
    {"name":"a removed entry is not in context","notebookID":"nb1","entries":[{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_a","state":"removed","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa"}}],"excluded":{},"expect":[]},
    {"name":"an untick holds while the entry's stamps are unchanged","notebookID":"nb1","entries":[{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_a","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa","approval":"L1759400001000.0000.aaaaaaaa"},"approval":"approved"},{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_b","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa"}}],"excluded":{"src_a":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa|L1759400001000.0000.aaaaaaaa"},"expect":["src_b"]},
    {"name":"an untick of an entry with no approval stores - for it","notebookID":"nb1","entries":[{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_a","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa"}}],"excluded":{"src_a":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa|-"},"expect":[]},
    {"name":"a re-add (new state stamp) ticks the source again (bug b5)","notebookID":"nb1","entries":[{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_a","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400005000.0000.bbbbbbbb","approval":"L1759400001000.0000.aaaaaaaa"},"approval":"approved"}],"excluded":{"src_a":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa|L1759400001000.0000.aaaaaaaa"},"expect":["src_a"]},
    {"name":"a re-approval (new approval stamp) ticks the source again","notebookID":"nb1","entries":[{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_a","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa","approval":"L1759400009000.0000.bbbbbbbb"},"approval":"approved"}],"excluded":{"src_a":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa|L1759400001000.0000.aaaaaaaa"},"expect":["src_a"]},
    {"name":"an approval added after an untick of an unapproved entry ticks it again","notebookID":"nb1","entries":[{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_a","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa","approval":"L1759400009000.0000.bbbbbbbb"},"approval":"approved"}],"excluded":{"src_a":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa|-"},"expect":["src_a"]},
    {"name":"a tick (null) puts the source back","notebookID":"nb1","entries":[{"containerKind":"notebook","containerID":"nb1","itemKind":"source","itemID":"src_a","state":"active","stamps":{"state":"L1759400000000.0000.aaaaaaaa"}}],"excluded":{"src_a":null},"expect":["src_a"]},
